      "q": "7. A Student Measures the Thickness of a Human Hair Using a Microscope of Magnification 100. He Makes 20 Observations and Finds that the Average Width of the Hair in the Field of View of the Microscope is 3.5 Mm. Estimate the Thickness of Hair.",
