      "q": "12. A bob of mass $$\\mathbf{0}.\\mathbf{1kg}$$ hung from the ceiling of a room by a string $2m$ long is set into oscillation. The speed of the bob at its mean position is $1m{{s}^{-2}}$. What is the trajectory of the bob if the string is cut when the bob is\nat one of its extreme positions,",
